      own EXC entry, so this is LIVE for them: the 2.6b-validated JOIN path can
      never run on those two modules, and it could only be measured with a
      numeric key.

   b) lib/org/freemedsoftware/api/FormTemplate.class.php:419
      ProcessData() (:339-530) calls $GLOBALS['sql']->num_rows($result).
      FreemedDb (lib/org/freemedsoftware/core/FreemedDb.class.php) implements no
      num_rows() and reaches no __call, so the call is `Error: Call to
      undefined method` - after the statement has been built and executed.
      Latent on the shipped tree: no XML template ships, so that path cannot be
      driven live (a limit Task 2.8 round 2 discloses about its own gating).

