      delimiter and `(` as a modifier: `Warning: preg_match(): Unknown modifier
      '('`, and the case never matches (measured: preg_match returns false).
      This is why the F4 date validation refuses that format instead of letting
      it become a zero date. CORRECTION: the plan attributed this method to
